@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@quizId = 1
@missingQuizId = 99999

### Actuator et informations d'instance
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/info
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/http.server.requests
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/mappings
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/env
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/beans
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/loggers
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes/instance-info

### Créer un quiz (remplacer @quizId par l'id renvoyé)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": 1,
  "title": "Quiz REST de démonstration",
  "duration": 20,
  "questions": [
    {
      "text": "Quelle annotation expose une API REST ?",
      "points": 2,
      "options": [
        { "text": "@RestController", "correct": true },
        { "text": "@Entity", "correct": false },
        { "text": "@Repository", "correct": false },
        { "text": "@Configuration", "correct": false }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### Liste et filtre par cours
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes?courseId=1

### Lire le quiz (aucun champ correct ne doit apparaître)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes/{{quizId}}

### Modifier le quiz (PUT remplace les questions)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes/{{quizId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": 1,
  "title": "Quiz REST modifié",
  "duration": 25,
  "questions": [
    {
      "text": "Quel outil construit le projet ?",
      "points": 2,
      "options": [
        { "text": "Maven", "correct": true },
        { "text": "React", "correct": false }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### Ajouter une question
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes/{{quizId}}/questions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Combien vaut 2 + 2 ?",
  "points": 1,
  "options": [
    { "text": "4", "correct": true },
    { "text": "5", "correct": false }
  ]
}

### Soumettre la tentative (utiliser questionId / optionId du GET)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes/{{quizId}}/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "student-demo-1",
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": 1, "optionId": 1 }
  ]
}

### Rejouer le même étudiant : 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes/{{quizId}}/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "student-demo-1",
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": 1, "optionId": 1 }
  ]
}

### Résultats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes/{{quizId}}/results

### 400 : requête invalide
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "courseId": null, "title": "", "duration": 0, "questions": [] }

### 404 : quiz absent
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes/{{missingQuizId}}

### DELETE (à lancer en dernier)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/quizzes/{{quizId}}
